    "description": "Agent-native credit-score estimator computed from the publicly documented FICO category weights (payment history 35%, utilization 30%, length 15%, mix 10%, new credit 10%) and mapped to the 300\u2013850 scale. /estimate returns an estimated score, an uncertainty band (\u00b120), a rating, and a per-factor breakdown with each factor's sub-score and impact. The one-call /lookup adds a prioritized improvement plan, reasoning (why_result_generated, key_factors, invalidators), and assumptions. A deterministic MODEL and explicit estimate \u2014 not your actual FICO/VantageScore \u2014 so confidence is intentionally below 1.0. No fabrication: every sub-score derives from your inputs.",
